{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15914","headline":"闻故人自征戍回 · 王建","name":"闻故人自征戍回","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔闻着征戍，三年一还乡。\n今来不换兵，须死在战场。\n念子无气力，徒学事戎行。\n少年得生还，有同堕穹苍。\n自去报尔家，再行上高堂。\n尔弟修废枥，尔母缝新裳。\n恍恍恐不真，犹未苦承望。\n每日空出城，畏渴携壶浆。\n安得缩地经，忽使在我傍。\n亦知远行劳，人悴马玄黄。\n慎莫多停留，苦我居者肠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15914.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15914","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}